      "support": "partial",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC6478865::web::000::abstract"
      ],
      "same_system": "no"
    },
    {
      "text": "Nanoscale precipitates can occur in Al0.7CoCrFeNi and contribute to strengthening.",
